//
// Result: [ ] No MFA method registration or removal activity detected outside expected self-service patterns
//         [ ] Results found — see findings below
//
// Findings:
//   Target account:
//   Initiating account:
//   Addition or removal:
//   Timeframe:
//   Notes:
//
// Conclusion:
//   [ ] No suspicious activity identified — MFA method change confirmed as legitimate (e.g. new device, lost phone, self-service)
//   [ ] Suspicious activity identified — escalating
//   [ ] False positive — reason:
